#~ msgid ""
#~ "Becoming part of the society of devoted amateur astronomers will give you "
#~ "access to these organized efforts to reach new levels in our ability to "
#~ "study the Earth’s moon. And it will give you peers and friends who share "
#~ "your passion for astronomy and who can share their experience and areas "
#~ "of expertise as you seek to find where you might look next in the huge "
#~ "night sky, at the moon and beyond it in your quest for knowledge about "
#~ "the seemingly endless universe above us."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "At blive en del af fællesskabet af hengivne amatørastronomer giver dig "
#~ "adgang til organiserede forsøg på at nå nye højder i studiet af Jordens "
#~ "måne. Samtidig får du ligesindede venner, der deler din passion for "
#~ "astronomi, og som kan dele deres erfaring og ekspertise, mens du "
#~ "planlægger, hvor du vil rette dit blik næste gang – mod nattehimlen, "
#~ "månen og videre ud i det næsten uendelige univers over os."

#~ msgid "Becoming part of the society of devoted amateur astronomers."
#~ msgstr "At blive del af et fællesskab af hengivne amatørastronomer."

#~ msgid "Bedroom Facilities"
#~ msgstr "Overnatningsfaciliteter"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Before you go to that big expense, it might be a better next step from "
#~ "the naked eye to invest in a good set of binoculars. There are even "
#~ "binoculars that are suited for star gazing that will do just as good a "
#~ "job at giving you that extra vision you want to see just a little better "
#~ "the wonders of the universe. A well designed set of binoculars also gives "
#~ "you much more mobility and ability to keep your “enhanced vision” at your "
#~ "fingertips when that amazing view just presents itself to you."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Før du kaster dig ud i den næste store investering, kan det være klogere "
#~ "at starte med et par gode kikkerter. Der findes endda kikkerter, der er "
#~ "velegnede til stjernekiggeri, og som giver dig det ekstra udsyn, du "
#~ "ønsker, så du kan opleve universet på en ny måde. Et par veludformede "
#~ "kikkerter giver dig samtidig større mobilitet og mulighed for altid at "
#~ "have dit 'forstærkede syn' ved hånden, når den fantastiske udsigt viser "
#~ "sig."

#~ msgid "Before you make your first purchase…"
#~ msgstr "Før du foretager dit første køb …"

#~ msgid "Beyond The Eye"
#~ msgstr "Hinsides øjet"

#~ msgid "Blog's Title"
#~ msgstr "Blogoverskift"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "But how do you sift through the amazing choices on offer? And more "
#~ "importantly, do you really trust the photographs and descriptions of the "
#~ "hotels that they have awarded themselves with the motivation of getting "
#~ "bookings? Traveler reviews can be helpful, but you need to exercise "
#~ "caution. They are often biased, sometimes out of date, and may not serve "
#~ "your interests at all. How do you know that the features that are "
#~ "important to the reviewer are important to you?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Men hvordan gennemgår du egentlig de fantastiske tilbud? Og vigtigere "
#~ "endnu: Kan du virkelig stole på de fotografier og beskrivelser, som "
#~ "hotellerne selv har lagt op for at tiltrække bookinger? Anmeldelser fra "
#~ "rejsende kan være nyttige, men du må være på vagt. De er ofte farvede, "
#~ "nogle gange forældede, og tager måske slet ikke højde for dine "
#~ "præferencer. Hvordan kan du vide, at de faciliteter, som var vigtige for "
#~ "anmelderen, også er vigtige for dig?"

