#~ msgid "Maui helicopter tours"
#~ msgstr "Maui-helikopterture"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Maui helicopter tours are a great way to see the island from a different "
#~ "perspective and have a fun adventure. If you have never been on a "
#~ "helicopter before, this is a great place to do it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Helikopterture over Maui er en fantastisk måde at opleve øen fra et helt "
#~ "nyt perspektiv og giver et underholdende eventyr. Hvis du aldrig har "
#~ "fløjet i helikopter før, er dette det perfekte sted at prøve det."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Maui helicopter tours are a great way to tour those places that can not "
#~ "be reached on foot or by car. The tours last approximately one hour and "
#~ "range from approximately one hundred eight five dollars to two hundred "
#~ "forty dollars person. For many, this is a once in a lifetime opportunity "
#~ "to see natural scenery that will not be available again. Taking cameras "
#~ "and videos to capture the moments will also allow you to relive the tour "
#~ "again and again as you reminisce throughout the years."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Helikopterture over Maui er en storslået måde at opleve områder, der ikke "
#~ "kan nås til fods eller i bil. Turene varer cirka en time og koster mellem "
#~ "185 og 250 dollars per person. For mange er det en oplevelse for livet at "
#~ "se de unikke naturlandskaber, som aldrig vil gentage sig. Ved at tage "
#~ "billeder og optage videoer kan du genopleve turen igen og igen og mindes "
#~ "oplevelsen gennem årene."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Maui helicopter tours will allow you to see all of these sights. Make "
#~ "sure to take a camera or video with you when going on Maui helicopter "
#~ "tours to capture the beauty of the scenery and to show friends and family "
#~ "at home all the wonderful things you saw while on vacation."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Maui-helikopterture vil give dig muligheden for at se alle disse steder. "
#~ "Husk at tage et kamera eller videokamera med dig, når du skal med Maui-"
#~ "helikopterture, for at fange den smukke natur, og vise venner og familie "
#~ "derhjemme, alle de vidunderlig ting du så, imens du var på ferie."

#~ msgid "Molokai Maui"
#~ msgstr "Molokai Maui"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Molokai Maui helicopter tours will take you to a different island but one "
#~ "that is only nine miles away and easily accessible by air. This island "
#~ "has a very small population with a different culture and scenery. The "
#~ "entire coast of the northeast is lined with cliffs and remote beaches. "
#~ "They are completely inaccessible by any other means of transportation "
#~ "than air.\n"
#~ "People who live on the island have never even seen this remarkable "
#~ "scenery unless they have taken Maui helicopter tours to view it. When the "
#~ "weather has been rainy and there is a lot of rainfall for he season you "
#~ "will see many astounding waterfalls."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Molokai Maui-helikopterture tager dig til en nærliggende ø, kun 9 mil "
#~ "væk, som er let tilgængelig fra luften. Øen har en meget lille befolkning "
#~ "og et helt anderledes landskab og kultur. Hele den nordøstlige kyst er "
#~ "præget af stejle klipper og øde kyststrækninger, som kun kan nås fra "
#~ "luften.\n"
#~ "Selv de lokale har sjældent set dette bemærkelsesværdige landskab, "
#~ "medmindre de har taget en helikoptertur fra Maui. Når regntiden har været "
#~ "rigelig, kan du desuden opleve utallige spektakulære vandfald."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "More important to the family traveler than the business traveler, you "
#~ "should find out just how child friendly the hotel is from the directory "
#~ "and make your decision from there. One thing worth looking for is whether "
#~ "the hotel offers a baby sitters service. For the business traveler "
#~ "wishing to escape children this is of course very relevant too – perhaps "
#~ "a hotel that is not child friendly would be something more appropriate!"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For familier på rejse er det vigtigere end for forretningsrejsende at "
#~ "finde ud af, hvor børnevenligt hotellet er. Sørg for at se på "
#~ "oplysningerne i gæsteinformationsmappen, og træf dine valg på baggrund af "
#~ "dem. Et vigtigt punkt er, om hotellet tilbyder babysitning. For "
#~ "forretningsrejsende, der ønsker et roligt ophold uden børn, kan et hotel, "
#~ "der ikke er børnevenligt, faktisk være et bedre valg!"

#~ msgid "No Cover"
#~ msgstr "Ingen forside"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "None of this precludes you from moving forward with your plans to put "
#~ "together an awesome telescope system. Just be sure you get quality advice "
#~ "and training on how to configure your telescope to meet your needs. Using "
#~ "these guidelines, you will enjoy hours of enjoyment stargazing at the "
#~ "phenomenal sights in the night sky that are beyond the naked eye."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Intet af dette udelukker dig fra at fortsætte dine planer om at samle et "
#~ "fantastisk teleskopsystem. Sørg blot for at få kvalificeret rådgivning og "
#~ "træning i, hvordan du konfigurerer dit teleskop, så det passer til dine "
#~ "behov. Følger du disse retningslinjer, vil du kunne nyde timevis af "
#~ "stjernekiggeri og opleve de fænomenale syn på nattehimlen, som ligger "
#~ "langt ud over det blotte øjes rækkevidde."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Not only knowing the weather will make sure your star gazing is rewarding "
#~ "but if you learn when the big meteor showers and other big astronomy "
#~ "events will happen will make the excitement of astronomy come alive for "
#~ "you."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ikke alene vil kendskab til vejret sikre, at dit stjernekiggeri bliver en "
#~ "succes, men hvis du også lærer, hvornår de store meteorregn og andre "
#~ "betydningsfulde astronomiske begivenheder finder sted, vil spændingen ved "
#~ "astronomi virkelig blive levende for dig."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Of course, to take your moon worship to the ultimate, stepping your "
#~ "equipment up to a good starter telescope will give you the most stunning "
#~ "detail of the lunar surface. With each of these upgrades your knowledge "
#~ "and the depth and scope of what you will be able to see will improve "
#~ "geometrically. For many amateur astronomers, we sometimes cannot get "
#~ "enough of what we can see on this our closest space object."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For at tage din fascination af månen til nye højder, er det en god idé at "
#~ "opgradere til et solidt begynder-teleskop, som vil afsløre betagende "
#~ "detaljer på månens overflade. Med dette udstyr vil både din viden og "
#~ "dybden af det, du kan observere, vokse markant. For mange "
#~ "amatørastronomer er månen det objekt, vi aldrig kan få nok af, fordi det "
#~ "ligger så tæt på os på himlen."

